<%= turbo_frame_tag "dashboard-content" do %>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-5">Applets</h2>
  <p class="mb-4">
    Archived applets from past chats/lessons.
  </p>
  <p class="mb-4 block">
    You can copy the code to your clipboard here, and then paste it into a JavaScript playground like jsfiddle.net.<br>
    Since the LLM is given specific instructions to generate applets, you'll need to either:
  </p>
  <ol class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-stone 
             list-decimal list-inside dark:text-white mb-4">
    <li>Provide an HTML &lt;div&gt; with an id of "sandbox" in a JS playground.</li>
    <li>Paste it back to the LLM in this app and ask it to run it for you.</li>
    <li>Have an LLM modify the code or help you to run it.</li>
  </ol>

  <%= render "applets/applets_table", applets: @applets %>

<% end %>

